<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Millipore downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Millipore downgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Gruntal &amp; Co said it downgraded Millipore Corp to outperform from strong buy.</p>
<p>-- said cut the 1997 earnings estimate to $2.28 a share from $2.60 a share and cut the 1998 estimate to $2.76 a share from $3.06 a share.</p>
<p>-- said trimmed the 12-month price target to $52 a share from $55 a share.</p>
<p>-- Millipore remained unchanged at 42-1/2.</p>
</text>
